  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are well-versed in a particular type of ofuda, making them more dificult to resist.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wisdom 13, Knowledge (religion) 2 ranks, and Sutra Caster</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one type of ofuda: Charm, Punitive, or Warding. Your sutra caster level is considered to be 1 higher than normal for these type of ofudas that you cast. You gain a +1 bonus to any caster level checks you might have to make with ofudas of that type.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can take this feat multiple times. Each time you must choose a different type of ofuda.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc117\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
